 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:15Z (RFD66606-2357) 'A position 3.8e8 m from the origin, moved 1000 times by 1 mm. Float32 spacing there is
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:16Z (RFD66606-2357) '32 m, some 480 soda cans.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:17Z (RFD66606-2357) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:18Z (RFD66606-2357) '- float32: 1.0 m after 1000 steps, about 15 soda cans. Placing 20000 random positions
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:19Z (RFD66606-2357) '  errs by 16 m at most.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:20Z (RFD66606-2357) '- df32: 9.3e-6 m after 1000 steps, 1/80 of a credit card. Placing the same positions
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:21Z (RFD66606-2357) '  errs by 4.8e-7 m at most.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:22Z (RFD66606-2357) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:23Z (RFD66606-2357) 'The float32 position did not move at all: each 1 mm step rounds away. The df32 position
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:24Z (RFD66606-2357) 'kept the steps. The placement error ratio is about 3.4e7 to 1.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:01:25Z (RFD66606-2357) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2357  1 LINE
 Text:Written

